          "upper": true,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_010",
            "string_index": 4,
            "utterance": 1,
            "control": "FFED",
            "operand": 50,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『乖女兒放心，我平安無事。",
                "　這可要多謝妳的朋友們，"
              ],
              [
                "　不然這回我真的是難逃劫數",
                "　了。』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_010",
            "string_index": 4,
            "utterance": 2,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 13,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『國王陛下，令我們納悶的是",
                "　敵方為何要對您下手？",
                "　您可知道其中的原因？』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 7,
          "upper": true,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_010",
            "string_index": 4,
            "utterance": 3,
            "control": "FFED",
            "operand": 50,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『簡單來說，他們是為了王家",
                "　至寶「黃金徽章」。』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 8,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_010",
            "string_index": 4,
            "utterance": 4,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 0,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『黃金徽章？那是什麼？』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 9,
          "upper": true,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_010",
            "string_index": 4,
            "utterance": 5,
            "control": "FFED",
            "operand": 51,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『這個就讓我來回答吧。",
                "　黃金徽章是亞克斯王家的祖",
                "　傳之寶，據說它有著莫大的"
              ],
              [
                "　神秘力量，所以幾代以來都",
                "　一直小心的收藏著，但是它",
                "　究竟有什麼功用，也一直都"
              ],
              [
                "　沒有人知道。』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 10,
          "upper": true,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_010",
            "string_index": 4,
            "utterance": 6,
            "control": "FFED",
            "operand": 50,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『他們把我綁到這裡來，",
                "　就是要逼我交出黃金徽章。",
                "　後來我被拷問得受不了了，"
              ],
              [
                "　終於告訴他們黃金徽章的所",
                "　在，還連累了執牢神殿的索",
                "　菲亞．．』"
              ]
